      194.06,
      392.5,
      205.07
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE MORTGAGE ACT",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F2"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.941100120544434
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      258.96,
      206.06,
      322.61,
      217.07
    ],
    "text": "(CHAPTER 89)",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F2"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.941100120544434
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.24,
      230.66,
      410.16,
      254.75
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.941100120544434
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.24,
      269.66,
      410.2,
      293.75
    ],
    "text": "1.(1)This Act may be cited as the Mortgage(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F2"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.941100120544434
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.24,
      308.66,
      410.26,
      358.67
    ],
    "text": "(2)The provisions of this Act, other than theprovisions of this section, shall come into operation on suchdate as the Minister may appoint by Order published in theGazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F3"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.941100120544434
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.24,
      373.7,
      410.2,
      410.75
    ],
    "text": "(3) The provisions of this section shall come intooperation on the date on which the Bill becomes an Act ofParliament.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.941100120544434
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.24,
      425.66,
      410.21,
      462.71
    ],
    "text": "2. The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 68 of the Mortgage Act (Chapter89) and shall have effect as section 68A of that enactment :-",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F2"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.941100120544434
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      226.32,
      477.74,
      410.32,
      566.75
    ],
    "text": "68A. The provisions of part III of this Actshall only apply to any movable property in sofar as they are not inconsistent with theprovisions of the Secured Transactions Act,No. of 2023, from and after the date ofcoming into operation of the said SecuredTransactions Act.\u2019\u2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F2"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.941100120544434
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.24,
      581.66,
      410.11,
      605.75
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F2"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.941100120544434
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      420.12,
      272.09,
      459.14,
      300.17
    ],
